  "sections": [
    {
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Joyful, joyful, we adore Thee, God of glory, Lord of love;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 31,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 45,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearts unfold like flowers before Thee, opening to the sun above.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 19,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 29,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 40,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 55,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 60,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melt the clouds of sin and sadness, drive the dark of doubt away;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 19,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 36,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giver of immortal gladness, fill us with the light of day.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 11,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 28,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 45,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "All Thy works with joy surround Thee, earth and heaven reflect Thy rays,",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 19,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 38,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 57,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stars and angels sing around Thee, center of unbroken praise.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 17,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 23,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 35,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 47,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Field and forest, vale and mountain, flowery meadow, flashing sea,",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 18,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 37,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 53,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanting bird and flowing fountain call us to rejoice in Thee.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 18,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 35,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 48,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 57,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Verse 3",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Thou art giving and forgiving, ever blessing, ever blest,",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 31,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 46,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wellspring of the joy of living, ocean depth of happy rest!",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 18,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 25,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 48,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou our Father, Christ our Brother, all who live in love are Thine;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 17,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 37,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 53,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teach us how to love each other, lift us to the joy divine.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Em"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "C"
            },
            {
              "position": 48,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "G"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
